        "text": "# Creative Collation Scan: Dog Gut Health Guide\n\n## Scan scope\n\nCreative collation: 867704329392724\nRepresentative ad: facebook_2749987068705812\nActive ads: 1 / 4\nMember ad IDs: facebook_1520786042390973, facebook_1637905404520515, facebook_37594701216841977, facebook_2749987068705812\n\n## 1. Hook / opening creative text\n\n> Ever since my dog, Rex, was a puppy, he’s had a sensitive tummy. With frequent bouts of gas, bloating, and loose poop, our quest to find the perfect diet for…\n\nSource: Primary ad text lead fallback; not visual/OCR extraction.\nPattern: unclassified.\nPattern reason: No supported hook-pattern heuristic matched the hook text.\n\n## 2. Copy framing\n\nEver since my dog, Rex, was a puppy, he’s had a sensitive tummy. With frequent bouts of gas, bloating, and loose poop, our quest to find the perfect diet for him felt never-ending.\n\nEven when we switched him to one of the most highly recommended raw diets, we still found ourselves at the vet every few months for anal gland expression. If we didn’t, he’d start scooting across the carpet or constantly licking his back end.\n\nWhen spring came around, things got even stranger — Rex started grazing on grass all the time and occasionally going for… let’s just say very questionable snacks 😬\n\nWe tried everything — bran, oats, even Greek yoghurt — but nothing really worked. Eventually, our vet suggested adding a pre & probiotic blend to his diet. The alternative was surgery to remove his anal glands, which we really wanted to avoid.\n\nAfter doing some research, we decided to try a probiotic chew supplement.\n\nWe’ve been using them for just over two weeks now, and honestly — the difference has been huge. Rex barely grazes on grass anymore, his stools are firm, and the gas has settled down massively.\n\nThe scooting? Almost completely gone.\n\nBest part — he actually loves the taste, so it’s not a battle to give them to him every day.\n\nIt’s such a relief seeing him comfortable, happy, and back to himself again.\n\nPerfect for sensitive tummies! 🐶\n\n## 3. Creative structure\n\nFormat: **video**\nCTA: **SHOP NOW** — selling out fast\nMedia URL: https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/980741dcb69a2cfaf6a8cefb88ed826eca74cc386e145cf873578a16717b60f1.mp4\nThumbnail URL: https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/5c53b08f7f0bc61761313c8b57513c04f39d5a1fad8e686bd515b5caeb64156a.jpg\n\n## 4. Landing page\n\nhttps://nutri-paw.com/products/pre-probiotic-digestive-treats _(domain: nutri-paw.com)_\n\n## 5. Performance signals\n\nReach: 3,284,560\nEstimated spend: €29,561\nAdvertiser reach (30d): 3,865,378\nLaunched: 2026-07-13\nStill live: Yes (59 days running)\nRank trajectory: improving\n\n## 6. Verdict\n\n**Scaling hard — worth modeling.**\n\n---\nCredits used: 3 | Remaining: 7398 | Source: recurring\nBreakdown: ad_detail:1(success), reach_history:1(success)"
